## Case: singleton-task-reuses-mailbox
id: "av.parity.1092.singleton-task-reuses-mailbox"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1092"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
#[single]
task Counter {
    count = 0
    on { n int -> { count = count + n; reply(count) } }
}
fn add_first() int { return await Counter.ask(19) }
fn main() int {
    let first = add_first()
    let second = await Counter.ask(23)
    Counter.stop()
    if first == 19 { return second }
    return 0
}
```

